    <DataNode elementId="AT5G11670-MONOMER" textLabel="NADP-dependent malic enzyme 2" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9LYG3" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="900" centerY="655" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The NADP-ME2 enzyme catalyzes the NADP+- dependent oxidative decarboxylation of |FRAME: MAL| leading to the formation of |FRAME: PYRUVATE| |CITS:[19725876][16113210][18288573]|. It can also act in the reverse direction in a reductive carboxylation reaction. In addition, it can also carry out pyruvate reduction and oxaloacetate decarboxylation &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; though these reactions were observed under non-physiological conditions (e.g. pH 5.5) |CITS: [18288573]|. NADP-ME2 can form homooligomers, most likely octamers and/or hexamers |CITS: [16113210]|. It is one of the three cytosolic isoforms found in Arabidopis |CITS: [19725876][16113210][18288573]|. The NADP-ME2 transcript appears to be constitutively expressed based on RT-PCR analyses |CITS: [16113210]|. Based on mutant analyses, NADP-ME2 appears to be the major source of NADP-ME activity in mature Arabidopsis plants |CITS: [16113210]|. It may serve several purposes including providing reducing power for |FRAME: PWY-361 monolignol biosynthesis| for lignin production, for controlling pH in the xylem via regulation of malate levels, and for also providing reducing power in general for several biosynthetic processes that take place in the cytosol |CITS: [16113210]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G11670-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT5G11670.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9LYG3" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AtNADP-ME2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="NADP-malic enzyme 2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-T9-2365" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0005829" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT5G11670.1" />
      <Property key="FunctionalAssignmentStatus" value=":AMBIGUOUS" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT5G11670" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="19725876" />
