      <Comment source="pmngroup">The protein encoded by the &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana MDH&lt;/i&gt; gene was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;. Crude extracts were shown to have malate dehydrogenase activity |CITS:[9774405]|. The protein was shown to be found in chloroplasts |CITS:[9774405]|.</Comment>
